1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:07,369
Ship it while I'm in the shower. An AI agent bought its own website. Domain, hosting, repo, even this video's voice.

2
00:00:07,419 --> 00:00:10,478
Paid per call, with real money, over two protocols,

3
00:00:10,528 --> 00:00:13,220
on two chains, through the Nevermined Router.

4
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:16,110
Chapter one. A human sets the budget.

5
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:21,750
Log in once. Email and a one-time code. No passwords, no cards on file.

6
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:29,557
The wallet holds USDC on Base and USDC.e on Tempo. Two chains,

7
00:00:29,607 --> 00:00:35,750
funded in advance. That is the last time a human touches money in this video.

8
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:40,370
Payment methods. Cards, wallets, and the spending delegations on each.

9
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:46,388
A crypto delegation. Forty dollars, twenty four hours. That is the whole guardrail.

10
00:00:46,438 --> 00:00:51,080
Not a confirmation dialog. A cap the server enforces on every single payment.

11
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:52,490
Create.

12
00:00:55,580 --> 00:01:00,200
And the API key the agent will carry was issued here. That is all the human does.

13
00:01:01,310 --> 00:01:03,650
Chapter two. The agent goes shopping.

14
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:08,850
Claude Code. One plugin. nevermined-router. That is the whole integration.

15
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:16,516
One instruction. Read the brief,

16
00:01:16,566 --> 00:01:20,140
you may spend up to forty dollars, and do not ask me first.

17
00:01:25,270 --> 00:01:28,365
We ask the agent to account for itself. What did it buy,

18
00:01:28,415 --> 00:01:31,510
on which protocol, on which chain, and what did it cost.

19
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:34,593
It reads its own log and the Router ledger.

20
00:01:34,643 --> 00:01:37,734
Everything it did is on record: a twenty dollar hosting top-up,

21
00:01:37,784 --> 00:01:38,880
the domain, the deploy.

22
00:01:39,870 --> 00:01:45,991
Two protocols, two chains. The hosting credit went over x402 on Base. The screenshot,

23
00:01:46,041 --> 00:01:50,202
and later this video's voice and music, over MPP on Tempo.

24
00:01:50,252 --> 00:01:53,760
The agent never held an account with any of them.

25
00:01:54,770 --> 00:01:58,690
Then it waits for the domain's DNS. Twenty minutes, compressed.

26
00:02:03,940 --> 00:02:07,836
It buys a screenshot of itself. ScreenshotOne, six cents,

27
00:02:07,886 --> 00:02:11,990
settled on Tempo. That image becomes the page's own preview.

28
00:02:13,940 --> 00:02:16,498
Before spending again it reads the Router ledger,

29
00:02:16,548 --> 00:02:20,810
so it never buys the same thing twice. Every purchase carries an idempotency key.

30
00:02:23,940 --> 00:02:26,398
It builds the receipt straight from the ledger.

31
00:02:26,448 --> 00:02:28,640
Every line is a real transaction on chain.

32
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:35,532
It renders its own page at desktop and phone widths,

33
00:02:35,582 --> 00:02:38,570
finds two layout bugs, and fixes them before deploying.

34
00:02:44,380 --> 00:02:47,320
It creates a public GitHub repo and pushes the source.

35
00:02:55,380 --> 00:02:58,230
Done. Inside the forty dollar cap. Nothing refused,

36
00:02:58,280 --> 00:03:00,390
nothing widened, no human clicked buy.

37
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:05,790
Chapter three. The receipt is the website.

38
00:03:06,740 --> 00:03:10,180
shippeditself.com. The site the agent shipped, on the domain it bought.

39
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:17,278
What it did, and how it works. The catalog quotes prices on the wire,

40
00:03:17,328 --> 00:03:20,181
the merchant answers 402, and the Router pays it,

41
00:03:20,231 --> 00:03:22,670
inside the cap. Two protocols, two chains.

42
00:03:23,670 --> 00:03:30,548
The receipt. Every line names the vendor, the protocol, the chain, the amount, the fee, and links the transaction.

43
00:03:30,598 --> 00:03:32,310
x402 and MPP. Base and Tempo.

44
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:36,565
It even includes the narration you are hearing and the music under it,

45
00:03:36,615 --> 00:03:37,780
bought the same way.

46
00:03:38,770 --> 00:03:41,002
And back in the app, the delegation. One budget.

47
00:03:41,052 --> 00:03:44,330
Everything in this video was paid from it, and it never had to say no.

48
00:03:45,440 --> 00:03:49,857
The tutorial repo has the brief, the agent's rules, the friction log,

49
00:03:49,907 --> 00:03:55,100
and the receipt. Install the plugin, set a budget, and ship yours. nevermined.ai.
